nd usually resolves; marked elevation suggests another cause."}, {"test_id": "alt", "ranges": {"moderate": {"min": 56, "max": 120}, "severe": {"min": 80, "max": 250}, "critical": {"min": 100, "max": 500}}, "frequency": "sometimes", "importance": "optional"}, {"test_id": "cr", "ranges": {"severe": {"min": 1.2, "max": 2.0}, "critical": {"min": 1.5, "max": 3.5}}, "frequency": "sometimes", "importance": "important", "caveat": "Rising creatinine in severe disease reflects dehydration, acute kidney injury, or multiorgan involvement."}, {"test_id": "bun", "ranges": {"severe": {"min": 20, "max": 40}, "critical": {"min": 25, "max": 60}}, "frequency": "sometimes", "importance": "optional"}, {"test_id": "na", "ranges": {"severe": {"min": 130, "max": 135}, "critical": {"min": 125, "max": 134}}, "frequency": "sometimes", "importance": "optional", "caveat": "Mild hyponatremia can occur with severe illness."}, {"test_id": "k", "ranges": {"severe": {"min": 3.0, "max": 3.5}, "critical": {"min": 2.8, "max": 3.4}}, "frequency": "sometimes", "importance": "optional"}, {"test_id": "hs_tnt", "ranges": {"severe": {"min": 15, "max": 60}, "critical": {"min": 25, "max": 150}}, "frequency": "sometimes", "importance": "important", "caveat": "Elevation suggests myocardial injury; check in severe disease or with chest pain, ECG changes, or hemodynamic instability."}, {"test_id": "nt_probnp", "ranges": {"severe": {"min": 150, "max": 600}, "critical": {"min": 300, "max": 1500}}, "frequency": "sometimes", "importance": "optional"}, {"test_id": "procalcitonin", "ranges": {"moderate": {"min": 0.1, "max": 0.5}, "severe": {"min": 0.25, "max": 1.5}, "critical": {"min": 0.5, "max": 4.0}}, "frequency": "sometimes", "importance": "optional", "caveat": "A low value argues against bacterial coinfection; a high value should prompt a search for bacterial superinfection."}, {"test_id": "lactate", "ranges": {"severe": {"min": 2.0, "max": 3.5}, "critical": {"min": 2.5, "max": 6.0}}, "frequency": "sometimes", "imp