ion or kidney impairment."}, {"test_id": "k", "ranges": {"mild": {"min": 3.3, "max": 3.5}, "moderate": {"min": 3.0, "max": 3.4}, "severe": {"min": 5.3, "max": 6.0}, "critical": {"min": 5.8, "max": 7.0}}, "frequency": "sometimes", "importance": "important", "caveat": "Low with osmotic diuresis or insulin; high with kidney failure or certain diabetes medicines."}, {"test_id": "na", "ranges": {"mild": {"min": 132, "max": 135}, "moderate": {"min": 128, "max": 134}, "severe": {"min": 120, "max": 130}, "critical": {"min": 115, "max": 125}}, "frequency": "sometimes", "importance": "important", "caveat": "Low with marked hyperglycemia or diuretic use; very high with severe dehydration."}, {"test_id": "hco3", "ranges": {"moderate": {"min": 18, "max": 22}, "severe": {"min": 12, "max": 18}, "critical": {"min": 5, "max": 12}}, "frequency": "sometimes", "importance": "important", "caveat": "Low in ketoacidosis or hyperosmolar states; a normal value argues against significant acidosis."}, {"test_id": "tg", "ranges": {"mild": {"min": 150, "max": 250}, "moderate": {"min": 200, "max": 500}, "severe": {"min": 400, "max": 1000}, "critical": {"min": 1000, "max": 3000}}, "frequency": "common", "importance": "important"}, {"test_id": "hdl", "ranges": {"mild": {"min": 35, "max": 45}, "moderate": {"min": 30, "max": 40}, "severe": {"min": 20, "max": 35}}, "frequency": "common", "importance": "important", "caveat": "Low HDL is part of the insulin-resistance pattern."}, {"test_id": "ldl", "ranges": {"mild": {"min": 100, "max": 130}, "moderate": {"min": 130, "max": 160}, "severe": {"min": 160, "max": 220}}, "frequency": "common", "importance": "important"}, {"test_id": "chol", "ranges": {"mild": {"min": 200, "max": 240}, "moderate": {"min": 240, "max": 300}, "severe": {"min": 300, "max": 400}}, "frequency": "common", "importance": "optional"}, {"test_id": "alt", "ranges": {"mild": {"min": 40, "max": 80}, "moderate": {"min": 60, "max": 150}, "severe": {"min": 100, "max": 300}}, "frequency": "co