 decade after age 40", "Women account for a larger share of clinic visits for dizziness, especially in middle age"], "risk_factors": [{"text": "Older age", "strength": "strong"}, {"text": "Prior head injury or ear surgery", "strength": "moderate"}, {"text": "History of migraine", "strength": "moderate"}, {"text": "Anxiety or depressive symptoms", "strength": "moderate"}, {"text": "Recent upper respiratory infection", "strength": "weak"}, {"text": "Female sex", "strength": "weak"}], "comorbidities": ["Hypertension", "Diabetes", "Coronary artery disease", "Anemia", "Hypothyroidism", "Anxiety or depression", "Migraine", "Osteoarthritis with chronic pain"], "family_history": ["Migraine", "Meniere's disease"], "social_history": ["Low fluid intake or heavy alcohol use", "Recent travel or cruise (motion sickness)", "Sedentary lifestyle with deconditioning"], "exposures": ["Prolonged bed rest or recent hospitalization", "Hot weather or exertion with poor hydration"], "risk_medications": ["hydrochlorothiazide", "furosemide", "lisinopril", "metoprolol", "amlodipine", "duloxetine", "sertraline", "gabapentin", "oxycodone", "zolpidem", "diphenhydramine", "meclizine", "diazepam", "metformin", "insulin"]}, "presentation": {"chief_complaints": [{"text": "I feel dizzy", "frequency": "almost_always"}, {"text": "The room is spinning", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "I feel lightheaded when I stand up", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "I feel unsteady on my feet", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "I get woozy when I turn my head", "frequency": "sometimes"}], "hpi": {"onset": "Varies by cause: sudden over seconds to minutes with BPPV or vestibular neuritis, or gradual over days to weeks with medication effects or deconditioning", "duration": "Episodes may last seconds (BPPV), minutes to hours (Meniere's or migraine), or days (vestibular neuritis)", "progression": "Often intermittent and recurrent; may improve spontaneously or persist until the underlying cause is treated", "location": "Felt in the head or as a whole-body sensation; not localized to one side", "radiation": "Not applicable", "quality": "Spinning or whirling sensation, or a floating, lightheaded, woozy feeling", "severity": "Mild to severe; can be disabling during attacks and may interfere with walking or driving", "timing": "Often triggered by specific movements or positions; may be constant or episodic", "aggravating": ["Rolling over in bed", "Looking up or bending over", "Standing up quickly", "Turning the head", "Walking in the dark", "Crowded or busy visual environments"], "relieving": ["Lying still with eyes closed", "Sitting or lying down", "Avoiding sudden head movements", "Staying hydrated"], "associated_symptoms": [{"text": "Nausea", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Vomiting", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Sweating", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Unsteady walking", "frequency": "common"}, {"text": "Ringing in the ears", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Hearing loss or muffled hearing", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Headache", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Sensitivity to light or sound", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Feeling of fullness in the ear", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Blurred vision during episodes", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Palpitations", "frequency": "rare"}, {"text": "Fainting", "frequency": "rare"}], "pertinent_negatives": ["Sudden weakness or numbness on one side of the body", "Slurred speech", "Double vision", "Difficulty swallowing", "Loss of consciousness", "Chest pain", "Shortness of breath", "Severe headache unlike any before", "Fever with neck stiffness", "New confusion", "Recent head trauma", "Inability to walk at all"]}, "ros": [{"system": "constitutional", "positives": [{"text": "Feeling tired", "frequency": "sometimes"}, {"text": "Feeling warm or sweaty during episodes", "frequency": "sometimes"}], "negatives": ["Fever", "Weight loss", "Night sweats"]}, {"system": "eyes", "positives": [{"