stion of a household medication or an adult's drug.", "missing_classic_features": ["Self-reported craving or loss of control", "Long-standing use history"]}, {"population": "immunocompromised", "how_it_differs": "Injection drug use with immune suppression raises the risk of unusual infections such as invasive fungal infections and atypical pneumonia, so fever and focal findings may dominate the picture.", "missing_classic_features": ["Typical withdrawal-focused presentation"]}]}, "exam": {"general": {"mild": "Alert, well-groomed, cooperative; may appear tired or restless", "moderate": "Ill-appearing, poor grooming or hygiene, restless or sedated, avoids eye contact", "severe": "Markedly disheveled, malodorous, thin, agitated or drowsy, poor insight", "critical": "Obtunded or unresponsive, cyanotic, shallow or agonal breathing, pinpoint or dilated pupils"}, "findings": [{"id": "pupil-size", "region": "heent", "maneuver": "Inspect both pupils in dim light and test reactivity to light", "finding": "Pinpoint pupils (opioid effect) or dilated pupils (stimulant or anticholinergic effect)", "frequency": "common", "significance": "supports", "importance": "essential"}, {"id": "nasal-septum", "region": "heent", "maneuver": "Inspect the nasal mucosa and septum with a light", "finding": "Septal perforation, crusting, or bleeding from intranasal use", "frequency": "sometimes", "significance": "supports", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "oral-hygiene", "region": "heent", "maneuver": "Inspect the teeth, gums, and oral mucosa", "finding": "Dental caries, missing teeth, gingivitis, or oral candidiasis", "frequency": "common", "significance": "supports", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "track-marks", "region": "extremities", "maneuver": "Inspect the antecubital fossae, forearms, hands, feet, and neck for puncture marks", "finding": "Linear scars, hyperpigmented tracks, or fresh injection sites", "frequency": "sometimes", "significance": "strongly_supports", "importance": "essential"}, {"id": "skin-abscess", "region": "skin", "maneuver": "Palpate any red, warm, or fluctuant area near injection sites", "finding": "Abscess, cellulitis, or induration", "frequency": "sometimes", "significance": "supports", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "skin-picking", "region": "skin", "maneuver": "Inspect the face, arms, and legs for excoriations", "finding": "Excoriations or sores from picking (stimulant use)", "frequency": "sometimes", "significance": "supports", "importance": "optional"}, {"id": "tremor", "region": "neuro", "maneuver": "Ask the patient to hold both arms outstretched with fingers spread", "finding": "Fine tremor of the hands", "frequency": "common", "significance": "supports", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "gait", "region": "neuro", "maneuver": "Observe the patient walking and turning", "finding": "Ataxia, unsteady gait, or wide-based gait", "frequency": "sometimes", "min_severity": "moderate", "significance": "supports", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "mentation", "region": "mental_status", "maneuver": "Assess orientation, attention, and recall during the interview", "finding": "Impaired attention, disorientation, or memory gaps", "frequency": "common", "min_severity": "moderate", "significance": "supports", "importance": "essential"}, {"id": "mood-affect", "region": "mental_status", "maneuver": "Ask about mood, anhedonia, and anxiety over the past two weeks", "finding": "Depressed or irritable mood, anxious affect", "frequency": "common", "significance": "supports", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "suicidal-ideation", "region": "mental_status", "maneuver": "Ask directly about thoughts of self-harm or suicide", "finding": "Passive or active suicidal ideation", "frequency": "sometimes", "significance": "supports", "importance": "essential"}, {"id": "psychosis", "region": "mental_status", "maneuver": "Ask about hearing voices or feeling watched or persecuted", "finding": "Paranoia, hallucinations, or disorganized speech during intoxication", "frequency": "sometimes", "significance": "supports", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "conjunctival-injection", "region": "heent", "maneuver": "Inspect the conjunctivae and sclerae", "finding": "Red, injected conjunctivae (cannabis or stimulant use)", "frequency": "sometimes", "significance": "supports", "importance": "optional"}, {"id": "cardiac-regular-rate", "region": "cardiac", "maneuver": "Auscultate the heart at the apex and base", "finding": "Regular rate and rhythm without murmur", "frequency": "almost_always", "significance": "neutral", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "lung-clear", "region": "lung", "maneuver": "Auscultate all lung fields", "finding": "Clear breath sounds without crackles or wheeze", "frequency": "almost_always", "significance": "neutral", "importance": "important"}, {"id": "abdomen-nontender", "region": "abdomen", "maneuver": "Palpate all four quadrants", "finding": "Soft, non-tender abdomen without organomegaly", "frequency": "almost_always", "significance": "neutral", "importance": "optional"}, {"id": "neuro-nonfocal", "region": "neuro", "maneuver": "Test strength, sensation, and deep tendon reflexes", "finding": "No focal motor or sensory deficit", "frequency": "almost_always", "significance": "neutral", "importance": "important"}]}, "vitals": {"temp": {"mild": {"min": 97.8, "max": 99.1}, "moderate": {"min": 98.6, "max": 100.4}, "severe": {"min": 99.5, "max": 101.5}, "critical": {"min": 100.0, "max": 103.0}}, "hr": {"mild": {"min": 60, "max": 100}, "moderate": {"min": 90, "max": 120}, "severe": {"min": 110, "max": 140}, "critical": {"min": 40, "max": 150}}, "rr": {"mild": {"min": 12, "max": 20}, "moderate": {"min": 16, "max": 24}, "severe": {"min": 22, "max": 30}, "critical": {"min": 6, "max": 34}}, "sbp": {"mild": {"min": 100, "max": 130}, "moderate": {"min": 120, "max": 150}, "severe": {"min": 140, "max": 180}, "critical": {"min": 70, "max": 200}}, "dbp": {"mild": {"min": 60, "max": 85}, "moderate": {"min": 75